msgid "Orders"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Help.php:57
msgid "The usual flow: Open → Paid (check that the payment arrived) → Shipped or Picked up. When you cancel, you decide per product whether the goods go back to the warehouse."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Help.php:58
msgid "“To do” shows everything waiting for you: payment open, to ship, pickup, refund. The ▸ before the number expands the quick view (items, address, history, internal note); “3 products ▸” expands the products."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Help.php:59
msgid "“Paid ✓” asks for the payment method and the date received. Under ⋯ you’ll find payment reminder, resend confirmation and cancel."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Help.php:60
msgid "Use the checkboxes on the left to select several orders and apply a bulk action. Customers are emailed automatically when an order is “paid” and “shipped”."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Help.php:61
msgid "You can only delete an order permanently from its detail view – order data is usually subject to a retention requirement."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Help.php:66
msgid "Visible/hidden: use the switch in the list to take a product out of the shop right away – it is kept. “Archive” also removes it from the working list."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Help.php:67
msgid "Quick edit changes name, price, category and visibility right in the row. “Duplicate” creates a hidden copy (stock 0)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Help.php:68
msgid "Bulk actions apply to all checked products. Permanent deletion is only possible from the archive."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Help.php:72
#: src/Admin/Menu.php:186
#: src/Admin/Menu.php:352
#: src/Admin/OrderDetailView.php:372
#: src/Admin/OrderDetailView.php:454
msgid "Stock"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Help.php:73
msgid "Stock is the sum of all bookings. Book in increases it, book out decreases it – every booking stays traceable in the history."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Help.php:74
msgid "“Low” means: stock is at or below the minimum stock (click the number in the list to change it). “Sold out” means: 0 or less – for products with sizes, a single empty size is enough."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Help.php:75
msgid "“On the shelf” also counts goods that are already sold but not yet shipped or picked up."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Help.php:76
msgid "Record delivery books in several products at once. During a stock count, only differences are booked as a correction."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Help.php:80
#: src/Admin/Menu.php:358
